      "comment": "OLD TIME ROCK (2) won a trial and was then beaten as the favourite fresh up, and he looked in need of the hit-out. He drops further in class, strips fitter, and with some gear changes, he can make amends. Follow your money. SHOOTING FOR STARS (4) has been racing consistently and looks ready to win again for the second time in her last 4 starts after back-to-back placings, including a strong third at Naracoorte over 1100m last start. Stick with her. NUDGE 'EM ALONG (5) was safely held when last seen at Naracoorte over 1100m at the end of his last prep, and he resumes with the advantage of the pole position on his home track where he has a strong record. Keep him safe. SUNSET PRAYER (6) resumes from a spell on her home track, and she is more than capable of figuring in the finish, especially if the money comes for her. UNIQUE POET (3) will be suited by the drop back to 900m on his home track, and is not the worst for wider combos.",
